# Deelbaar mobile UX

**Read first:** [docs/design/mobile-ux-master.md](../../docs/design/mobile-ux-master.md)

## Non-negotiable

- **Never** show API or contract text in the UI (`auth_required`, `interaction.reason`, “Interaction locked”, raw enum names).
- **Map cards:** no auth or entitlement labels; guests browse cards like everyone else.
- **Gate on action:** guests who tap protected actions (save/favorite, follow, alerts, full listing when gated) get the sign-in modal; use human copy only. **Never** favorite, follow, or persist saved state while logged out — use `runMapProtectedAction` in `apps/core/src/features/map/mapProtectedAction.ts`.
- **Tabs:** Map · Favorites · Account; Favorites guest + Account upsell share GuestAuthCard template; Account guest/signed-in share skeleton (hosting under Account).
- **i18n:** English and Dutch for all new user-visible strings.

## When implementing

Design from the master doc (user journeys and access layers), not by copying whatever the current screen does.

Complete the checklist at the bottom of `mobile-ux-master.md` before finishing.

**UI verification:** layout contract + **Layout proof** + agent-device a11y assert — `.cursor/rules/verify-ui-copy-with-screenshot.mdc` and `docs/design/agent-visual-verify.md`.
